---
description: Any pubspec change — justify deps, review gate, scope-matched validation (no AI-only adds).
globs:
  - pubspec.yaml
  - pubspec.lock
  - apps/*/pubspec.yaml
  - apps/*/pubspec.lock
  - packages/*/pubspec.yaml
  - packages/*/pubspec.lock
  - tool/**/pubspec.yaml
  - tool/**/pubspec.lock
alwaysApply: false
---

# Pubspec / lockfiles

- Justify each add or upgrade; prefer an existing package or repo utility.
- Apply `docs/ai_code_review_protocol.md` before calling the change done.
- Scope-matched validation; `./bin/checklist` when the surface is broad or risky.
- No dependency added only because an AI suggested it — one-line rationale in task/PR.
